// Cinematic, 3D-forward sales landing page for "সবার জন্য সাইবার নিরাপত্তা".
// Route: /works/cybersecurity-for-everyone-ebook (the /works index stays a
// plain list of work cards).
//
// Language: Bangla throughout (technical terms stay in Latin script), per
